{% schema %}
  {
    
    "name": "Section 3",
    "tag": "section",
    "class": "gps-620425776872817251 gps gpsil",
    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/procolored/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=GP_ARTICLE&editorId=620425760582140575&sectionId=620425776872817251)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"false"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"ggrTc1zd7ZU_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggrTc1zd7ZU_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0509/3454/6613/files/procolored-blog-author-Greg.png"},{"type":"html","id":"ggacZ8Dt8M6_text","label":"ggacZ8Dt8M6_text","default":"<p><strong>By Greg</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gggqtz9RYdN_text","label":"gggqtz9RYdN_text","default":"<p><span style=\"color:#161723;\"><strong>Published:</strong></span> &nbsp;May 21, 2026</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggoXl59eO_O_text","label":"ggoXl59eO_O_text","default":"<p>The wait is over — Procolored X one is officially launched on Kickstarter. &nbsp; &nbsp;<br><br>Built for small business owners, craft creators, DIY makers, and tech enthusiasts, X one combines UV printing, laser engraving, and UV DTF sticker creation into one streamlined workflow — helping you create more and earn more with less space, less complexity, and less cost. &nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<br>Whether you want to print on custom products, engrave designs, or produce UV DTF stickers for your own business, X one makes the entire workflow easier than ever.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggAVaTOqhsr_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggAVaTOqhsr_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0509/3454/6613/files/x-one-desktop-uv-printer-small-business-studio_jpg.jpg"},{"type":"html","id":"ggAVaTOqhsr_alt","label":"ggAVaTOqhsr_alt","default":"Procolored X one desktop UV printer set up in a small business studio for custom product creation"},{"type":"html","id":"ggqOYlcff0W_text","label":"ggqOYlcff0W_text","default":"<span style=\"background-color:#FCFCFC;color:#F18769;\">What Is Procolored X one?</span>"},{"type":"html","id":"gghFq6GdAaF_text","label":"gghFq6GdAaF_text","default":"<p><a href=\"https://www.procolored.com/blogs/news/evolution-of-x-one-3-in-1-uv-printer\">Procolored X on</a>e is<a href=\"https://www.procolored.com/blogs/news/evolution-of-x-one-3-in-1-uv-printer\"> a desktop fabrication platform built for creators who would otherwise need three separate machines: a </a>UV flatbed printer<a href=\"https://www.procolored.com/blogs/news/evolution-of-x-one-3-in-1-uv-printer\">, a laser engraver, and a UV DTF sticker maker.</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>it grew from years of <a href=\"https://www.procolored.com/blogs/news/evolution-of-x-one-3-in-1-uv-printer\" target=\"_blank\"><u>watching creators juggle multiple workflows</u></a>. Instead of juggling equipment, transferring workpieces between stations, and battling registration errors, X one handles the entire workflow in one alignment, one setup, one machine.<br><br><a href=\"https://www.procolored.com/blogs/news/evolution-of-x-one-3-in-1-uv-printer\">The system runs four production processes under a single hood. Full-color UV printing reaches up to 1440 DPI, driven by dual UV printheads supporting CMYK, white ink, and varnish. Laser engraving runs on a dual-laser configuration: a 20W blue diode laser for wood, acrylic, leather, and plastics, plus a 2W infrared laser optimized for precise metal marking.&nbsp;</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.procolored.com/blogs/news/evolution-of-x-one-3-in-1-uv-printer\">The same dual-laser system handles laser cutting on the same substrate you just printed. And roll-to-roll UV DTF sticker production is integrated directly — finished, peel-ready transfers come out in one pass, with no separate laminator required.</a><br><br><a href=\"https://www.procolored.com/blogs/news/evolution-of-x-one-3-in-1-uv-printer\">With a maximum working height of up to 140 mm, X one accommodates tumblers, oversized signage, irregular objects, and bulky promotional items that most desktop UV printers simply cannot fit.</a></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggBzj3XX4Tq_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggBzj3XX4Tq_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0509/3454/6613/files/X_one_Specs_2.png"},{"type":"html","id":"ggBzj3XX4Tq_alt","label":"ggBzj3XX4Tq_alt","default":"Procolored X one specifications: 1440 DPI dual XH-6 UV printheads with CMYK plus white and varnish, 20W blue diode and 2W infrared dual-laser system, CCD vision positioning with 140mm working height, 400+ compatible materials with no primer required."},{"type":"html","id":"gg3RHZBURh9_text","label":"gg3RHZBURh9_text","default":"<span style=\"color:#F18769;\">Why Choose Procolored X one?</span>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggWqY4lfG3c_text","label":"ggWqY4lfG3c_text","default":"<p>X one is not a UV printer with a laser bolted onto the side. The two technologies are co-designed so each one makes the other better. That distinction shows up in four concrete ways.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggsUITZj-0v_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggsUITZj-0v_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0509/3454/6613/files/x-one-uv-print-color-durability-comparison_jpg.jpg"},{"type":"html","id":"ggsUITZj-0v_alt","label":"ggsUITZj-0v_alt","default":"Illustration of Procolored X one UV print color and varnish retention over new, 3-year, and 5-year stagesthe appearance of the image"},{"type":"html","id":"ggSA-YWUqGN_text","label":"ggSA-YWUqGN_text","default":"Laser pre-treatment replaces chemical primers."},{"type":"html","id":"gglG4Vf6Ifk_text","label":"gglG4Vf6Ifk_text","default":"<p>Traditional <a href=\"https://www.procolored.com/collections/uv-printer\" target=\"_blank\"><u>UV printing</u></a> on metal, glass, or polished plastic relies on a separate adhesion promoter — a chemical step that introduces fumes, trial-and-error, and extra inventory. X one’s laser conditions the surface directly before printing, so ink bonds firmly without any primer at all. Less mess, fewer consumables, faster setup.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggmWGdVai-X_text","label":"ggmWGdVai-X_text","default":"Engrave-then-print in one alignment."},{"type":"html","id":"gg2jBzpeWZD_text","label":"gg2jBzpeWZD_text","default":"<p>&nbsp;X one engraves the relief and prints the color in the same pass, without removing the workpiece. No realignment. No registration drift. No wasted blanks.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggj3a16wn9k_text","label":"ggj3a16wn9k_text","default":"Print, then cut from the same substrate."},{"type":"html","id":"gghXkXKoO8d_text","label":"gghXkXKoO8d_text","default":"<p>Custom acrylic signs, layered keychains, intricate stickers — X one cuts the finished shape from the same material it just printed on, in one workflow.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggDT3amq7Eo_text","label":"ggDT3amq7Eo_text","default":"Built-in UV DTF, no laminator needed."},{"type":"html","id":"ggjGFyjws2O_text","label":"ggjGFyjws2O_text","default":"<p>UV DTF stickers normally require a separate laminator step. X one integrates roll-to-roll UV DTF production directly, so stickers come off the machine peel-and-stick ready.<br><br>The system also runs more independently than typical desktop UV machines. CCD camera positioning and infrared height detection let X one read each object’s placement and surface contour automatically.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>An onboard touchscreen handles job control complementing the desktop software where designs are set up and production is queued. White ink circulation, agitation, and self-cleaning systems are engineered to protect the printheads through long, unattended production runs.<br><br>Across 400+ compatible materials — including acrylic, wood, metal, leather, glass, stainless steel, ceramic, and plastic — X one delivers consistent, commercial-grade results from the first piece to the last.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggBqMmHCVK3_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggBqMmHCVK3_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0509/3454/6613/files/x-one-laser-engraving-detailed-3d-relief_jpg.jpg"},{"type":"html","id":"ggBqMmHCVK3_alt","label":"ggBqMmHCVK3_alt","default":"Procolored X one creating a detailed 3D relief with its 20W blue diode laser engraver"},{"type":"html","id":"ggdKqfAuI07_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggdKqfAuI07_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0509/3454/6613/files/x-one-full-color-uv-printing-engraved-bird_jpg.jpg"},{"type":"html","id":"ggdKqfAuI07_alt","label":"ggdKqfAuI07_alt","default":"Procolored X one printing full-color UV ink onto a laser-engraved bird relief in one workflow"},{"type":"html","id":"ggbsZBp6FzZ_text","label":"ggbsZBp6FzZ_text","default":"<span style=\"color:#F18769;\">Designed for Whom?</span>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggNhhvVvqpa_text","label":"ggNhhvVvqpa_text","default":"<p>Procolored X one is specifically designed for:</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggwCD2i9JrI_childItem_0","label":"ggwCD2i9JrI_childItem_0","default":"<p>Small business owners</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggwCD2i9JrI_childItem_1","label":"ggwCD2i9JrI_childItem_1","default":"<p>DIY makers and hobbyists</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggwCD2i9JrI_childItem_2","label":"ggwCD2i9JrI_childItem_2","default":"<p>Tech enthusiasts</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggwCD2i9JrI_childItem_3","label":"ggwCD2i9JrI_childItem_3","default":"<p>Etsy and Shopify sellers</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggwCD2i9JrI_childItem_4","label":"ggwCD2i9JrI_childItem_4","default":"<p>Custom gift shops</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggwCD2i9JrI_childItem_5","label":"ggwCD2i9JrI_childItem_5","default":"<p>Creative studios</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggHbqVvRjRV_text","label":"ggHbqVvRjRV_text","default":"<p>X one is the machine you would choose if you sell — or want to sell — wood signs with engraved relief and color-fill logos, etched metal nameplates, custom acrylic awards combining 3D engraving and color, personalized tumblers and bottles, layered keychains, leather tags, or <a href=\"https://www.procolored.com/collections/uv-dtf-printer\" target=\"_blank\"><u>UV DTF</u></a> stickers for irregular and curved surfaces.<br><br>Instead of investing in multiple machines, you can now run an entire workflow from a single setup. Whether you’re starting a small business or scaling an existing one, X one assists you from idea to finished product.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggDRbFBPG_s_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggDRbFBPG_s_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0509/3454/6613/files/x-one-precision-laser-engraving-metal-closeup_jpg.png"},{"type":"html","id":"ggDRbFBPG_s_alt","label":"ggDRbFBPG_s_alt","default":"Close-up of Procolored X one's precision infrared laser engraving on a metal surface"},{"type":"html","id":"ggMdymxltOy_text","label":"ggMdymxltOy_text","default":"<span style=\"color:#F18769;\">Check Out Your Launch Special Offer</span>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggMPiwAzpF1_text","label":"ggMPiwAzpF1_text","default":"<p>The Procolored X one is now available on Kickstarter at up to 54% off projected retail pricing, with three bundles built for different production needs:</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggoYvKD-33f_text","label":"ggoYvKD-33f_text","default":"Basic Bundle — $3,799 (53% off MSRP $7,999)"},{"type":"html","id":"ggqLac2ssk-_text","label":"ggqLac2ssk-_text","default":"<p>The core setup. Includes the X one, protective goggles, 1,250ml UV ink kit (5×250ml bottles), Material Kit, Accessories Kit, Exhaust Hose, A3 platform, A3 protective cover, and A5 printing platform.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg9ShZNYI2s_text","label":"gg9ShZNYI2s_text","default":"Standard Bundle — $3,999 (54% off MSRP $8,599)"},{"type":"html","id":"ggo6BL0KAbe_text","label":"ggo6BL0KAbe_text","default":"<p>Everything in Basic, plus the UV-DTF Kit (Sticker Fixture Kit) and Rotary Attachment Kit — adding integrated UV DTF sticker production and rotary printing for cylindrical objects like tumblers and bottles.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggA-ciF4C3N_text","label":"ggA-ciF4C3N_text","default":"Professional Bundle — $4,199 (54% off MSRP $8,999) — Most Backed"},{"type":"html","id":"ggIWm-oTPN9_text","label":"ggIWm-oTPN9_text","default":"<p>The complete 3-in-1 setup. Everything in Standard, plus an additional 2W IR Laser Head for precision metal marking. This is the configuration most early backers have chosen.</p><p><br>All three bundles ship globally with estimated delivery in January 2027. Launch pricing is limited to the Kickstarter campaign window and historically moves quickly on Procolored launches — the previous K Series campaign raised nearly $1.8M from hundreds of creators within days.</p><p><br>If you have been thinking about starting a custom-product business, upgrading an existing setup, or finally consolidating multiple workflows into a single machine, this is the moment.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggDUY-mnpO6_text","label":"ggDUY-mnpO6_text","default":"Meet X one on Kickstarter"},{"type":"html","id":"ggyJ1tYurpI_text","label":"ggyJ1tYurpI_text","default":"<p><span style=\"color:#EA3335;\">Up to 54% Off&nbsp;</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggdHgXj8u7b_label","label":"ggdHgXj8u7b_label","default":"<p>Explore Launch Offer&nbsp;</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggh-FWoL29p_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggh-FWoL29p_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0509/3454/6613/files/1_72830595.png"},{"type":"html","id":"ggvgQujjUsR_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggvgQujjUsR_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://gempages-demo.myshopify.com/cdn/shop/t/1/assets/495611768014373769-ef8ac6a5-a4c5-4b08-b9c0-fe972cadf6b6_768x768.png?v=4640590167630680311705458916"},{"type":"html","id":"ggy0l8PhVk4_text","label":"ggy0l8PhVk4_text","default":"<span style=\"color:#F18769;\">Frequently Asked Questions</span>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggjxayRzDb6_childItem_0","label":"ggjxayRzDb6_childItem_0","default":"<p>What is the difference between X one and a regular UV printer?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggjxayRzDb6_childItem_1","label":"ggjxayRzDb6_childItem_1","default":"<p>What materials can X one print and engrave on?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggjxayRzDb6_childItem_2","label":"ggjxayRzDb6_childItem_2","default":"<p>Does X one require UV primer or adhesion promoter?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggjxayRzDb6_childItem_3","label":"ggjxayRzDb6_childItem_3","default":"<p>What is the maximum print height on X one?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggjxayRzDb6_childItem_4","label":"ggjxayRzDb6_childItem_4","default":"<p>What inks does X one use, and is white ink included?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggjxayRzDb6_childItem_5","label":"ggjxayRzDb6_childItem_5","default":"<p>Is X one suitable for beginners?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggjxayRzDb6_childItem_6","label":"ggjxayRzDb6_childItem_6","default":"<p>When will the Procolored X one ship?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggjxayRzDb6_childItem_7","label":"ggjxayRzDb6_childItem_7","default":"<p>How much does the Procolored X one cost?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggGOshWDzgP_text","label":"ggGOshWDzgP_text","default":"<p>A regular UV printer prints. X one prints, engraves with two different laser types, cuts, and produces UV DTF stickers — in one machine, one alignment, one workflow. It also uses its laser to pre-treat surfaces, so most jobs do not need a separate UV primer.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg4Ya6BhBIU_text","label":"gg4Ya6BhBIU_text","default":"<p>X one is compatible with 400+ materials. You can print on acrylic, wood, leather, glass, metal, stainless steel, ceramic, plastic, and more. The 20W blue diode laser handles wood, acrylic, leather, and plastics; the 2W infrared laser is optimized for metal marking.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggKDMCb6Fle_text","label":"ggKDMCb6Fle_text","default":"<p>For most materials, no. X one’s laser pre-treatment conditions the surface directly before printing, eliminating the need for a separate chemical primer on most jobs. This saves time, removes a toxic step from the workflow, and reduces inventory.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggIVTbyZxwn_text","label":"ggIVTbyZxwn_text","default":"<p>X one accepts workpieces up to 140 mm tall, which fits most tumblers, large bottles, thick signs, and irregular objects that do not fit on standard desktop UV printers.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg4swJGezRb_text","label":"gg4swJGezRb_text","default":"<p>X one supports a full CMYK + White + Varnish ink configuration at up to 1440 DPI. All Kickstarter bundles include a UV ink kit of 1,250ml (five 250ml bottles) shipped with the machine.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggG91sdQHIk_text","label":"ggG91sdQHIk_text","default":"<p>X one is designed for creators across experience levels. An onboard touchscreen provides quick controls and job status at the machine, while design setup runs through Procolored's desktop software. CCD camera positioning aligns workpieces automatically, and AI-powered design tools plus a growing template library shorten the path from idea to finished product. Procolored also provides lifetime customer support.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggcsaDL27Pp_text","label":"ggcsaDL27Pp_text","default":"<p>All Kickstarter bundles ship globally with estimated delivery in January 2027. Check the official Kickstarter campaign page for the most current updates and tier-specific shipping information.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggo-kwVUmXx_text","label":"ggo-kwVUmXx_text","default":"<p>The Procolored X one is available on Kickstarter in three bundles: Basic at $3,799, Standard at $3,999, and Professional at $4,199 — representing 53–54% off the projected retail prices of $7,999, $8,599, and $8,999 respectively. All bundles ship with estimated delivery in January 2027. Launch pricing is available only during the Kickstarter campaign window.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggqfYLXwjwQ_text","label":"ggqfYLXwjwQ_text","default":"<p><strong>Table of Contents</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg-1fv-aAuq_childItem_0","label":"gg-1fv-aAuq_childItem_0","default":"<p><a href=\"#sec1\"><span style=\"background-color:#FCFCFC;color:#424153;\">What Is Procolored X one?</span></a></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg-1fv-aAuq_childItem_1","label":"gg-1fv-aAuq_childItem_1","default":"<p><a href=\"#sec2\" class=\"ck-link_selected\" draggable=\"false\">Why Choose Procolored X one?</a></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg-1fv-aAuq_childItem_2","label":"gg-1fv-aAuq_childItem_2","default":"<p><a class=\"ck-link_selected\" href=\"#sec3\" draggable=\"false\">Designed for Whom?</a></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg-1fv-aAuq_childItem_3","label":"gg-1fv-aAuq_childItem_3","default":"<p><a class=\"ck-link_selected\" href=\"#sec4\" draggable=\"false\">Check Out Your Launch Special Offer</a></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg-1fv-aAuq_childItem_4","label":"gg-1fv-aAuq_childItem_4","default":"<p><a class=\"ck-link_selected\" href=\"#sec5\" draggable=\"false\">Frequently Asked Questions</a></p>"}],
